  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      268.61,
      401.9,
      292.91
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      307.61,
      401.89,
      331.91
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka RupavahiniCorporation (Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      346.61,
      401.88,
      383.99
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 3 of the Sri Lanka Rupavahini CorporationAct, No. 6 of 1982 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended as follows :-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      398.57,
      401.86,
      422.99
    ],
    "text": "(1)by the repeal of subsection (1) thereof and thesubstitution therefor, of the following subsection:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      206.85,
      437.57,
      401.87,
      461.87
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(1) The Corporation shall consist of thefollowing members \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      222.57,
      476.57,
      401.87,
      539.87
    ],
    "text": "(a)one, ex-officio member namely,Secretary to the Ministry of the Ministeror an officer not below the rank of anAdditional Secretary of that Ministrynominated by that Secretary;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      222.57,
      554.57,
      401.88,
      591.95
    ],
    "text": "(b)four members nominated in thefollowing manner and appointed by theMinister:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      247.89,
      606.53,
      401.87,
      669.95
    ],
    "text": "(i) one member who shall be arepresentative of the Ministry of theMinister assigned the subject ofFinance nominated by suchMinister;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      347.11,
      454.29,
      384.98
    ],
    "text": "Amendmentof section 3of Act, No. 6of 1982",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
